@startuml
title UC 2.1: Execute a Job At a Scheduled Time - Database Schema Design

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #ffe6cc
  BorderColor #d79b00
  BorderThickness 2
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #56517e
  BorderStyle dashed
  BackgroundColor transparent
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333

rectangle "**Azure SQL Hyperscale 'job-orchestrator'**\n//Primary storage for Job Orchestrator. Stores schedule snapshots and run state//" as ORCH {

  class JobScheduleSnapshot #dae8fc {
    + [PK] JobId: UNIQUEIDENTIFIER (required)
    + UserId: UNIQUEIDENTIFIER (required)
    + ConcurrencyMode: ENUM Singleton / Concurrent (required)
    + ScheduleType: ENUM OneTime / Recurring (required)
    + RepeatStepSize: INT (optional)
    + RepeatStepUnit: ENUM Minute / Hour / Day / Week / Month (optional)
    + NextRunAt: DATETIME2 (required)
    + LaunchDetails: NVARCHAR(MAX) JSON (required)
    + Status: ENUM Active / Inactive / Deleted (required)
    + Version: INT (required)
    + CreatedAt: DATETIME2 (required)
    + CurrentRunId: UNIQUEIDENTIFIER (optional, Singleton lock holder)
    + LockedUntil: DATETIME2 (optional, lease = JobRun.Deadline)
    --
    IX (NextRunAt) WHERE Status = Active
    <i>created in UC 1.1; lock columns added in UC 2.1</i>
  }

  class JobRun {
    + [PK] Id: UNIQUEIDENTIFIER (required, = RunId)
    + [FK] JobId: UNIQUEIDENTIFIER (required)
    + ScheduledFor: DATETIME2 (required, = DateTimeUtc)
    + Status: ENUM Pending / Running / Succeeded / Failed / TimedOut / LockFailed / Cancelled (required)
    + ServiceBusSequenceNumber: BIGINT (optional, to cancel the scheduled message)
    + Deadline: DATETIME2 (optional)
    + StartedAt: DATETIME2 (optional)
    + FinishedAt: DATETIME2 (optional)
    + ErrorSummary: NVARCHAR(1000) (optional)
    + CreatedAt: DATETIME2 (required, auto)
    --
    UQ (JobId, ScheduledFor)
    IX (Status, Deadline)
  }

  class JobRunOutbox {
    + [PK] Id: UNIQUEIDENTIFIER (required)
    + [FK] RunId: UNIQUEIDENTIFIER (required)
    + EventType: ENUM ExecuteJob / NotifyFailure (required)
    + Payload: NVARCHAR(MAX) JSON (required)
    + ScheduledEnqueueAt: DATETIME2 (required)
    + CreatedAt: DATETIME2 (required, auto)
    + ProcessedAt: DATETIME2 (optional)
    + Attempts: INT (required, default 0)
    --
    IX (CreatedAt) WHERE ProcessedAt IS NULL
  }

  JobScheduleSnapshot "1" -- "0..*" JobRun : is executed as
  JobRun "1" -- "0..*" JobRunOutbox : emits
}

rectangle "**Azure Cosmos DB 'job-outputs'**\n//Runner outputs and logs. Partitioned by RunId, TTL cleans up old data//" as COSMOS {

  class JobOutputEntry #dae8fc {
    + [id] Id: GUID (required)
    + [PartitionKey] RunId: GUID (required)
    + Timestamp: DATETIME (required)
    + Level: ENUM Info / Warning / Error (required)
    + Message: TEXT (required)
    + ttl: INT (required)
  }
}

JobRun -[#6c8ebf,bold]right---> JobOutputEntry : <b>execution produces</b>\n1 : 0..* via RunId\nlogical reference, no cross-DB FK

note as ISO
  <b>Isolation level: READ COMMITTED (RCSI)</b>
  <b>Claim</b> (one transaction):
  1. SELECT due snapshots WITH (UPDLOCK, READPAST): rows stay locked
     until commit, so parallel claimers skip them instead of double-claiming.
  2. Advance NextRunAt for every claimed job (OneTime -> Status = Inactive).
  3. Singleton only: UPDATE ... SET CurrentRunId, LockedUntil
     WHERE CurrentRunId IS NULL OR LockedUntil < now; 0 rows -> LockFailed.
  4. INSERT JobRun (Pending) + JobRunOutbox (ExecuteJob).
  UQ (JobId, ScheduledFor) makes the claim idempotent.
  <b>Status updates:</b> compare-and-set on the expected status;
  terminal states are never overwritten. Lock release:
  ... WHERE CurrentRunId = @RunId (only the owning run).
  <b>Job edited/deleted:</b> the Orchestrator cancels the scheduled message
  by ServiceBusSequenceNumber, marks the run Cancelled, releases the lock.
  Serializable is not needed: every conflict is on a single locked row.
end note
JobScheduleSnapshot -[hidden]right- ISO
ISO -[hidden]down- JobOutputEntry

note bottom of JobOutputEntry
  <b>Consistency: Session</b>
end note
@enduml
